coordinate-based proximity filtering\n- feat(search): add relevance sorting using MongoDB text index scores\n\n- feat(items): enhance item management with comprehensive CRUD operations\n- feat(items): add EditItemModal component for inline item editing\n- feat(items): implement RecentItemsFeed component for displaying latest items\n- feat(items): add geospatial indexing and proximity-based item retrieval\n- feat(items): enhance item model with improved validation and text indexing\n\n- feat(auth): implement centralized authentication store with Pinia\n- feat(auth): add authentication state management and token handling\n- feat(auth): create authHeader utility for API authentication\n- feat(auth): enhance login/register views with improved UX\n\n- feat(messages): improve messaging system with enhanced UI components\n- feat(messages): update MessageForm and MessageList with better styling\n- feat(messages): enhance message routing and controller functionality\n\n- feat(backend): add comprehensive logging and error handling\n- feat(backend): implement advanced query processing with geospatial support\n- feat(backend): enhance API endpoints with improved parameter validation\n- feat(backend): add detailed console logging for debugging search operations\n\n- feat(ui): enhance navigation with improved NavBar component\n- feat(ui): update ProfileEditor and ProfileView with better user experience\n- feat(ui): improve ItemDetailView and ItemPostView with enhanced functionality\n- feat(ui): add responsive design improvements across all views\n\n- docs: add comprehensive backend flow diagram (SVG)\n- docs: update README with current project status and features\n\n- refactor(services): enhance itemService with improved error handling and logging\n- refactor(services): update messageService with better API communication\n- refactor(security): improve security utilities with enhanced validation\n\n- chore: update dependencies and configuration files\n- chore: enhance .gitignore a